<title>POLAND: INDYKPOL WANTS MOVE TO BOURSE MAIN MARKET.</title>
<headline>INDYKPOL WANTS MOVE TO BOURSE MAIN MARKET.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish poultry producer Indykpol SA applied to the Warsaw bourse to move its shares from the parallel to the main market of the exchange.</p>
<p>It did not give details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
